  "description": "A marriage she believed to be perfect came to an end after just three years. After divorcing her ex-husband Kang In, Jimin returns to her hometown as if escaping. There, she meets her young and handsome neighbor, Ji-hyuk… \n\nA younger man who shows her pure devotion, and her once-beloved, perfect ex-husband. She had clearly intended to let everything go and enjoy a quiet life in the countryside, but then these two men shook her world. What kind of flower will bloom at the end of this turmoil?\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/summer_flower)",
